  "title": "Heather M NDE 4501",
  "date": "1988",
  "content": "I was freebasing cocaine and seized. I left my body and saw myself seizing including graphic physical unpleasant visualizations. I was tied up. I was told while I was unconscious to envision a rope and climb up it. I pictured myself at the bottom of a deep pit, or black tunnel with a light at the top. I pictured a rope and physically felt as if I was climbing up it toward the light (life.) I did also feel the general impression it was a choice to do so. When I reached the top, I regained consciousness. But this was not one experience. It opened a door to many other experiences. I received messages from God and Buddha in a dream, many years later, right before miscarrying a child.",
